Asset delivery generate 0.1.0
Copyright 2026 openAdam

This product includes software developed by openAdam.

Generation is ordinary local PNG decode / cover-crop / downscale / encode.
It does not implement org.openadam.raster.prepare, does not implement
org.openadam.brand-asset.prepare, and does not bind the unpublished
asset-prep provider.

After writing a new output directory, this draft calls the existing
asset-delivery-preflight 0.1.0 combinator by ordinary function import.
Slot comparison stays in that module. Observation uses the File Vitals
capability-jsonl adapter (io.github.tetracoralla.file-vitals 0.3.3) to
implement org.openadam.file.inspect@0.1.0 inspect. File Vitals remains a
separate product under its own Apache-2.0 license.
